  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Moment of inertia of disc about the axis passing its centre and perpendicular to its surface,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>.<br />Radius of small sphere <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math> is related as<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Moment of inertia of sphere about its axis passing through its centre<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>80</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>80</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>140</mn></math>",
